From 2d678043a356466448f70a32d9f458c0d8be034e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChenghaoLiu <linkmecry@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:41:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] [LoongArch] Add MC layer COFF object writer support

Add minimal WinCOFF object writer and streamer to enable
`clang --target=loongarch64-windows-gnu -c` to emit COFF objects:
- Add IMAGE_FILE_MACHINE_LOONGARCH64 (0x6264) and COFF relocation types
- Map abstract fixups and raw R_LARCH_* relocations to COFF relocation types
- Dispatch COFF in AsmBackend/TargetMachine/MCAsmInfo/Streamer/Triple
- Skip ELF-only linker-relaxation (R_LARCH_RELAX) path for COFF targets
---
